  "details": "See the attached image. The ellipsis happens on the MM top left header title \"Marketplace\" in Japanese, French, and Russian.\n\nThe same issues happened before:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/localization/p/settings-social-headers-could-use-a-wider-field\n\nThough they are fixed now, this time the string is longer. Japanese string is \"マーケットプレイス\". It needs one more character space.\n\nYou should consider that it allows two lines. (I tried to put `{ln}` in the middle of the string to shorten the width, but it doesn't work.)",
